<title>USA: FBL Financial clears buyback program.</title>
<headline>FBL Financial clears buyback program.</headline>
<dateline>WEST DES MOINES, Iowa 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>FBL Financial Group Inc said it has authorized a repurchase program for up to one million unregistered shares of its Class A common stock.</p>
<p>The repurchase plan is limited to certain Farm Bureau property-casualty insurance companies owning shares of FBL.</p>
<p>The company said the repurchase program is designed to alleviate downward pressure on its common stock which could result from a compulsory sell-off of large blocks of stock in the open market. Stock purchases will be made at prevailing market prices.</p>
</text>
